# Sites for the browser tools: copy to .env.browser. Only the browser container reads the values.
# Per site: <NAME>_URL, plus any secrets as <NAME>_<WHAT>. The model sees names, never values:
# it types e.g. "CRM_PASSWORD" and Playwright fills in the real value.
#
# CRM_URL=https://crm.dev.example.local/login
# CRM_USER=
# CRM_PASSWORD=
#
# KIBANA_URL=http://kibana.dev.example.local:5601
# KIBANA_USER=
# KIBANA_PASSWORD=
